{
  "id": "jq3dLPZ1tBS3xEOT",
  "name": "Deploy event intake",
  "description": "Receives deploy events by webhook (serviceName, version, status). Failed deploys are logged to the Deploy Events data table first, then posted to #deploy-alerts, so a Slack outage cannot lose the record. Successful deploys are only logged. Built so deploy",
